{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_0_level_main_00-08_beg","groupId":"main_0","stageId":"main_00-08","title":"狩猎","storyCode":"0-8","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_00-08_beg.txt","sourceHash":"3ad95d5ecf83361f112f6e7e87e1de026fe0832e1a9d04e739deb6cdf3e753ea","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第五关（前）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_5"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"梅菲斯特？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"你没有拒绝的理由吧？一些不小心飞进来的小虫子......值得你亲自追击吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"我的部队已经接到了你的情报，你已经尽到了你的责任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"接下来，请你回去吧。毕竟你负责的是核心能源区及其外围......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"少做多余的事......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"你还有其他事情要做，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"好。随便你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"我已经等不及要观赏你的惨败了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"哦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"收队。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......敌人的头目......带着一部分整合运动的部队，撤离了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"这小子，在做什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"不能放松警惕......敌人的数量，依然是我们的数倍之多！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"唉唉，弑君者的口气一直不是很礼貌，请允许我代她道歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"你们可以称呼我，梅菲斯特。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"你们整合运动，究竟要做什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"也没什么。其实，放你们离开也无所谓。毕竟刚开始，你们也不算是整合运动的目标。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"既然我们不是整合运动的目标，那为什么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，我有幸观赏了你们的战斗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"你们的作战方式和你们的人员配置，很有趣哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"......有趣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"说战场的厮杀......有趣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛......我看过你们的资料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"原本，我只把你们当作是普通企业。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"现在看来，你们所涉猎的，可远远超出了摆弄试管的范畴哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"要是让你们轻轻松松地离开，就没什么意思了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"我想和各位，来一场祭祀式的竞赛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"......我们没工夫和心智不全的小孩子浪费时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"（阿米娅，准备好，我们可能要强行突围了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"（我来吸引他的注意力......！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"（啊，嗯！）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"......刚刚那是什么？你是向谁，打了什么信号吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"与你无关，小子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"（阿米娅？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，都是些企业人士了，连谈话时要注意礼节这个道理，都不明白吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"就是因为这世界上像你这样的人越来越多，才导致我不得不多学些能够形容你们的词汇！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"（阿米娅，发生什么了？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"（杜宾......我们的撤退路线，都被他的部队封锁了！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"（怎么会！短短几分钟内，他——）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"这样不好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"我诚心诚意地邀请你们......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"你们却只想着——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"——逃之夭夭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"呿！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"其实，只要你们赢了，就可以安全地离开我的猎场。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"接下来，我的这些朋友们，会不断地尝试杀掉你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"你们只要活下来，就是胜利！怎么样，规则，很简单吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"Ace！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"已经做好了强行突围的准备！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"但我们要先扛过这次围攻！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么，明明天灾就要来了！再不撤出切城，所有人都会——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"你在说什么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"正因为是天灾降临......这可是，一个最该被好好庆祝的时刻了呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"我高贵的客人们，能邀请你们参加游戏，我感到十分荣幸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......啊......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"杀......杀！！杀了......他们！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅！小心！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，对了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"其实，我们是知道你们在核心区里做了什么的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"那个你们从核心区里救出来的，一直遮住面庞的家伙......令人非常，非常在意呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"——？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"弑君者只关心你们之后要做什么，要去哪里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"我不一样。我只关心......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"你，是什么？从哪里来？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"对，你，就是现在，盯着我看的你......你和我们有点不一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"那个设施里，究竟是什么装置，有着保存生命的功能呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"我非常，非常好奇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"我也不是那种冷血的人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"来吧，罗德岛的客人们，把这个家伙当成见面礼留给我吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"那样的话，虽然令人惋惜，但我放你们离开，也是可以的哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"博士——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"——退到我身后！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米娅"]},{"speakerId":"char_014_riope","aliases":["Ace"]},{"speakerId":"char_016_medic","aliases":["医疗干员"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["整合运动成员"]},{"speakerId":"char_130_doberm","aliases":["杜宾"]},{"speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","aliases":["弑君者"]},{"speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","aliases":["？？？","梅菲斯特"]}]}
